cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ProactiveInquirer"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it and the paper it accompanies."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Levy
    given-names: Ido
  - family-names: Yehudai
    given-names: Asaf
  - family-names: Shlomov
    given-names: Segev
  - family-names: Adi
    given-names: Asaf
  - family-names: Choshen
    given-names: Leshem
abstract: >-
  Code for measuring and training proactive information-seeking in tool-using agents:
  horizontal proactivity (needs the current state already names) and vertical proactivity
  (needs only newly found evidence names), scored against need graphs without a model judge,
  and Q&D (questioner and drafter), which trains a questioner from the consequences of its
  questions.
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/dolev31/ProactiveInquirer"
keywords:
  - proactive agents
  - information seeking
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - agent evaluation
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: "Asking for What Was Never Requested: Horizontal and Vertical Proactivity in Agents"
